      {
        "mode": "Metro",
        "has": true,
        "best": true,
        "text": "RTA Rapid rail: the Red Line links the airport to downtown. Blue and Green Lines serve the east side. The Waterfront Line tram connects Tower City to the Flats, stadium and Rock Hall."
      },
      {
        "mode": "Bus",
        "has": true,
        "best": true,
        "text": "RTA buses cover the city. The Health Line BRT runs Euclid Avenue from downtown to University Circle. An all-day RTA pass costs about $5 and covers buses and trains."
      },
      {
        "mode": "Taxi / ride apps",
        "has": true,
        "text": "Taxis are metered. Uber and Lyft both operate widely."
      },
      {
        "mode": "Rental car",
        "has": true,
        "text": "Driving is easy with grid streets and light traffic. Downtown has purple district signs."
      },
      {
        "mode": "Walking",
        "has": true,
        "text": "Walking works well downtown. Bike trails and paths are expanding."
      }
